.Dd May 29, 2026
.Dt ZDOTS-CTX 1
.Os zdots
.Sh NAME
.Nm zdots-ctx
.Nd interface to the PostgreSQL-backed zdots knowledge layer
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Ar command
.Op Fl -json
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
bridges shell sessions, AI tools, and the PostgreSQL intelligence suite.
It searches methodologies and lessons, hydrates context for agents, captures
session residue, manages async jobs, and performs database maintenance.
.Sh COMMANDS
.Bl -tag -width clear-stale-jobs
.It Cm status
Report database metadata and connection state.
.It Cm query Op Fl -semantic Ar term
Search methodologies and lessons.
.It Cm hydrate Op Ar tag
Emit AI-ready context.
.It Cm capture
Distill current observable session into residue when capture is enabled.
.It Cm diagnose-log Ar bootstrap|update|upgrade
Package deploy logs via
.Xr zdots-log-analyze 1 .
.It Cm init-db , Cm migrate
Create or migrate the database using migration privileges.
.It Cm add-methodology , Cm add-lesson , Cm ingest , Cm seed
Insert knowledge records.
.It Cm sync-history
Sync buffered command analytics.
.It Cm enqueue , Cm requeue , Cm jobs , Cm worker , Cm triage , Cm clear-stale-jobs , Cm metrics-loop
Manage async jobs and queue metrics.
.It Cm backup , Cm restore
Create or restore SQL dumps.
.El
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width Fl
.It Fl -json
JSON output for supported commands.
.It Fl -semantic
Use embedding-backed semantic retrieval for query.
.It Fl -dry-run
Preview supported ingest or sync actions.
.It Fl -all
Ingest all supported knowledge-vault documents.
.It Fl -force
Force enqueue behavior where supported.
.It Fl -type Ar type
Worker job type filter.
.It Fl h , Fl -help
Show usage.
.El
.Sh ENVIRONMENT
.Bl -tag -width ZDOTS_DATABASE_URL_OVERRIDE
.It Ev ZDOTDIR
Repository root.
.It Ev ZDOTS_DATABASE_URL
Application database URL. Defaults to
.Li postgresql://zdots_rw@/my .
.It Ev ZDOTS_MIGRATION_URL
Migration database URL. Defaults to
.Li postgresql:///my .
.It Ev ZDOTS_DATABASE_URL_OVERRIDE
Force application URL regardless of env sourcing.
.It Ev ZDOTS_MY_ROOT
Identity monorepo root. Defaults to
.Pa ~/my .
.It Ev ZDOTS_CAPTURE_ENABLED
Must be
.Li 1
for
.Cm capture .
.It Ev ZDOTS_CMD_ANALYTICS
Enables command analytics sync path.
.It Ev ZDOTS_SESSION_ID
Session identifier used by capture.
.It Ev ZDOTS_AI_MODE , Ev ZDOTS_AI_ENDPOINT
AI boundary and endpoint for semantic retrieval or distillation.
.It Ev ZDOTS_REDIS_HOST , Ev ZDOTS_REDIS_PORT
Analytics buffer endpoint.
.El
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width ~/.local/state/zdots/history.sqlite3
.It Pa db/migrations/
Sequel migrations.
.It Pa ~/.local/state/zdots/history.sqlite3
SQLite analytics buffer.
.It Pa ~/.local/state/zsh/traces.jsonl
Trace stream used by capture.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Bl -tag -width 2
.It 0
Success.
.It 1
General failure.
.It 2
Capture disabled or usage/policy failure.
.El
.Sh PHI SAFETY
Capture is opt-in and blocked unless
.Ev ZDOTS_CAPTURE_ENABLED=1 .
Do not write raw patient records to prompts or tracked files.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr ai-query 1 ,
.Xr zdots-env 5 ,
.Xr zdots-phi-safety 7
